  << /ActualText (Promoted to Grade 5 in recognition of leadership\054 product ownership\054 and contributions to enterprise accessibility initiatives\056\nLed end\055to\055end UX design for enterprise applications\054 translating complex business requirements into intuitive\054 scalable\054 and accessible digital experiences\056\nContributed to the modernization of a 20\053 year\055old trade compliance platform\054 improving information architecture\054 navigation patterns\054 and the usability of complex compliance workflows\056\nConducted stakeholder interviews\054 usability evaluations\054 heuristic assessments\054 and research synthesis to identify user needs and guide design decisions\056\nCreated user journeys\054 wireframes\054 interactive prototypes\054 and high\055fidelity designs\054 collaborating with product managers and engineering teams throughout implementation\056\nChampioned accessibility\055first design practices\054 incorporating WCAG principles and inclusive interaction patterns into enterprise product experiences\056\nFacilitated design critiques\054 stakeholder workshops\054 and cross\055functional reviews to align product direction and improve design quality\056\nMentored UX designers through knowledge\055sharing sessions\054 accessibility advocacy\054 and constructive design feedback\056)
